{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2021-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1611446400, "end_date": 1612137599, "month_true_total": 264, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:48:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "85718874", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005148155", "personaname": "Captain Flint", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198005148155/", "num_games_owned": 306, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3011, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 694, "last_played": 1720396062, "avatar": "16a9db630dcda74c542cb8e10d7460505964bd9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bought this after browsing the action roguelite tag in early access and for early access the gameplay is extremely polished. Guns feel unique and punchy aside from a few undertuned ones. I maxed my base out at least for the current patch but I am eager to see more from this dev! Also soundtrack is perfect for this game. IF everything in the development roadmap is fulfilled this will be a mainstay for me easily.", "timestamp_created": 1612127267, "timestamp_updated": 1612127267, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85718229", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036535348", "personaname": "Gorbino's Quest", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/CertifiedGhoul/", "num_games_owned": 560, "num_reviews": 129, "playtime_forever": 2689, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 201, "last_played": 1773005602, "avatar": "f950084c94e21001a38bc036dec2339445a425db"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome arena style Roguelike. It is what Gunfire Reborn should have been.", "timestamp_created": 1612126610, "timestamp_updated": 1612126610, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85717439", "author": {"steamid": "76561198068624557", "personaname": "BylliGoat", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bylligoat/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 107, "playtime_forever": 4748, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4748, "last_played": 1741815297, "avatar": "b1cb4d0b4066a6485de3036fb286d4e8be8d3824"}, "language": "english", "review": "Feeling good.  Might get carpal tunnel later.\n\n--\n\nPost-launch update - still feels good.  Probably one of the best feeling rogue like shooters there is.", "timestamp_created": 1612125659, "timestamp_updated": 1753506548, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85715285", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088224397", "personaname": "Roger Wilco", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/chrisdaley007/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 3541, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 488, "last_played": 1744572922, "avatar": "75c0009a367ef14a1cc592f2ce2b873719bec672"}, "language": "english", "review": "96% of users recommend this.. my only question is, WTF is wrong with that other 4%?", "timestamp_created": 1612123169, "timestamp_updated": 1612123169, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85710958", "author": {"steamid": "76561198144102982", "personaname": "OrangeCase", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/djk12121/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 768, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 576, "last_played": 1724040462, "avatar": "06dc2a624ea58624660e717430e0c7f27ee2f93d"}, "language": "english", "review": "As of now, the game is a limited and redundant and can sometimes get boring. But, that doesn't mean it has room to improve. Gameplay wise, it is extremely fun and exciting. The different types of weapons and perks are pretty awesome and show this game has a lot of potential. The current limited levels and bosses are two of my biggest issues, but that can be solved once the creators add more content with each major patch. Personally, enjoy playing games solo, but this game is definitely better coop. Highly recommend this game!", "timestamp_created": 1612118288, "timestamp_updated": 1612118288, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}